WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.157
Lesson five. Animals!

2
00:00:04.106 --> 00:00:11.340
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.281 --> 00:00:13.770
Coco, we're at the farm!

4
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.436
Listen! Meow! Woof! Let's meet the animals!

5
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.536
Cat! The cat says meow! Say it with me. Cat!

6
00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:33.978
Dog! The dog says woof! Say it with me. Dog!

7
00:00:37.914 --> 00:00:41.231
Fish! Say it with me. Fish!

8
00:00:45.307 --> 00:00:50.390
Bird! Tweet, tweet! Say it with me. Bird!

9
00:00:54.346 --> 00:00:59.213
Duck! Quack, quack! Say it with me. Duck!

10
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:07.588
Cow! Moo! Say it with me. Cow!

11
00:01:11.657 --> 00:01:17.038
Move like the animals! Swim like a fish!

12
00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:20.592
Fly like a bird!

13
00:01:20.642 --> 00:01:24.126
Waddle like a duck!

14
00:01:24.176 --> 00:01:25.417
Great moving!

15
00:01:26.611 --> 00:01:30.919
Who says moo?

16
00:01:30.969 --> 00:01:32.120
The cow!

17
00:01:33.121 --> 00:01:37.417
Who says quack?

18
00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:38.617
The duck!

19
00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.367
Mimi, who says woof?

20
00:01:41.417 --> 00:01:43.620
The dog! Woof, woof!

21
00:01:44.488 --> 00:01:50.955
This is E. E is for egg. Egg! E is for elephant. Elephant!

22
00:01:54.941 --> 00:02:02.301
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:02.351 --> 00:02:03.900
Bye-bye, friends!

